design:
The first CLI slice should not add an interactive rules-system selector. It should preserve current UX by defaulting to D&D SRD for Emberfall campaigns, while leaving explicit APIs ready for future selection. Registry metadata may include base rules identity for display, but it must not become the authoritative source.

Initial test sketch:
```ts
const entry = runNewCommand(['Demo'], deps);
const db = openDatabase(loadRegistry(root).campaigns[0].dbPath);
expect(readCampaignRulesBinding(db)?.base.systemId).toBe('dnd5e-srd');
```
